aragon-ai (1.5.62) stable; urgency=medium

  * Log of the AI server: the line with what was heard now also says what
    the carrier sentence did (used, nothing after it, not found, off), and
    every voice command ends with one line that names the room, also those
    handed back to the Maestro or left unanswered. One search of the log
    shows what was heard, how and where.
  * Cloud AI: a radio station asked for by name ("Spela Groove Salad",
    "Sätt på Radio Nova") is now played: your Sonos favourite of that name,
    otherwise a Spotify search. Before, cloud AI answered that the radio
    cannot be played yet. "Turn on the radio" without a station name is
    still not possible.
  * Super scenes: a SAY text can now be spoken in the language spoken at
    home (needs the flow of 2026-10-17).
  * Online voice: Arabic, Finnish, Romanian and Slovak are now spoken by the
    online voice too. KugelAudio has no voice of its own for them, so a voice
    of the closest language speaks them: Slovak a Czech one, Romanian an
    Italian one, Finnish a Hungarian one, Arabic an English one. Another can
    be chosen.
  * Online voice: a sentence that ends with a number, such as the time
    ("Klockan är 16 48"), is now read correctly; before, the last number
    could be mispronounced or followed by a breath.
  * Online voice: new test of the voice of any language on a satellite
    (needs aragon-maestro 2.5.17).
  * Cloud AI: when a look-up tool answers with an error, the Maestro now says
    it could not do it, instead of an answer the AI made up.
  * Cloud AI: short commands said softly ("God morgon", "Klockan",
    "Godnatt") are understood more often. When the first transcription hears
    nothing, the second one now uses the language spoken at home (before: it
    guessed the language and often heard German, English or French), and a
    single word is no longer thrown away as noise. A command in another
    language that reaches this second step is translated into the language
    spoken at home.

