aragon-ai (1.5.22) stable; urgency=low

  * Fixed a bug where Spotify voice control could reject a valid request
    because the AI misheard/invented a room name that wasn't in the
    original request (e.g. "play music by talking heads" failing because
    it guessed a room called "studio"). It now falls back to the room
